## Layer semantics (governing rule)

```text
concept/    EVERY concept arising from study gets written — none skipped
reference/  CITATIONS from the official book — verbatim quotes, claim mapping
fixture/    compilable practice code — rustc must accept each file
```

## Toolchain

Rust toolchain: rustc 1.97.1. Fixtures compile with `rustc --edition 2021 {file}.rs`.

## Anchored skills

`skills/` — symlinked skill catalog, live links to the sources (no copies, no staleness). 12 symlinks resolve 30 SKILL.md files:

```text
workspace (relative → ../../../.opencode/skills/): knowledge-languages, playwright-dispatcher,
    reason-invariants, reason-quantitative, reason-verbal, refactor-skill, search-dispatcher,
    semantic-dispatcher, study-foundations, workflow-dispatcher
home (absolute): find-skills → ~/.agents/skills/find-skills, omarchy → ~/.claude/skills/omarchy
```

